WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.992 --> 00:00:02.598
- Hi everyone, I'm Oscar Isaac.
- And I'm Ethan Hawke.

00:00:02.648 --> 00:00:04.700
OSCAR ISAAC
And we are about to watch the trailer

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:07.289
of our new series Moon Knight,
on Disney+. You ready?

00:00:07.461 --> 00:00:08.680
ETHAN HAWKE
Yeah. Hit the spacebar.

00:00:09.273 --> 00:00:10.140
OSCAR ISAAC
Let's do this.

00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:14.820
[Clock ticking]

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:16.980
OSCAR ISAAC
I can really do a Rubik's cube,

00:00:17.031 --> 00:00:17.684
by the way.

00:00:17.734 --> 00:00:19.105
ETHAN HAWKE
You're kind of like a genius.

00:00:19.156 --> 00:00:19.763
OSCAR ISAAC
I am.

00:00:20.039 --> 00:00:21.598
ETHAN HAWKE
Ok. This is creepy so far.

00:00:21.648 --> 00:00:22.298
OSCAR ISAAC
Uh-huh.

00:00:22.349 --> 00:00:23.247
ETHAN HAWKE
I'm liking it.

00:00:25.031 --> 00:00:26.273
OSCAR ISAAC
My waking life...

00:00:26.867 --> 00:00:28.336
Please, sir, can I have some more?

00:00:28.719 --> 00:00:29.896
ETHAN HAWKE
Are you laughing or crying?

00:00:30.664 --> 00:00:31.763
OSCAR ISAAC
Maybe... We don't know.

00:00:33.138 --> 00:00:34.700
ETHAN HAWKE
Why do you have restraints in your bed?

00:00:34.763 --> 00:00:35.510
That's not cool.

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:36.725
♫ Day and night ♫

00:00:38.349 --> 00:00:39.998
OSCAR ISAAC
A little Kid Cudi. Come on!

00:00:40.049 --> 00:00:41.189
♫ In my mind ♫

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:42.287
STEVEN
I'm losing it.

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:44.673
ETHAN HAWKE
That's my favorite shot right there.

00:00:44.724 --> 00:00:45.740
OSCAR ISAAC
That's a good one.

00:00:46.888 --> 00:00:47.943
DONNA
You're bloody useless.

00:00:48.003 --> 00:00:50.303
- She makes me laugh.
- Lucy, she's like the best.

00:00:50.354 --> 00:00:51.198
OSCAR ISAAC
So funny.

00:00:51.615 --> 00:00:52.308
ETHAN HAWKE
With a V.

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:53.964
OSCAR ISAAC
Stevie with a V.

00:00:54.224 --> 00:00:55.374
OSCAR ISAAC
Oh, oh!

00:00:55.425 --> 00:00:56.086
What was that?

00:00:56.136 --> 00:00:57.099
ETHAN HAWKE
All right, that's creepy.

00:00:58.036 --> 00:00:59.986
You gotta... you gotta get more rest.

00:01:00.037 --> 00:01:00.807
[Screams]
[Elevator dings]

00:01:00.857 --> 00:01:01.993
ELDERLY WOMAN
Thank you.

00:01:03.115 --> 00:01:04.662
STEVEN
Lost a contact lens.

00:01:05.154 --> 00:01:06.471
ELDERLY WOMAN
Hope you find it.

00:01:06.521 --> 00:01:07.498
STEVEN
Thanks.

00:01:09.218 --> 00:01:10.421
OSCAR ISAAC
This March!

00:01:10.679 --> 00:01:12.468
My birthday's in March,
it's a good sign.

00:01:13.031 --> 00:01:13.734
Oh!

00:01:14.101 --> 00:01:15.886
The reflection!
What was that about?

00:01:15.937 --> 00:01:17.124
ETHAN HAWKE
Oh! Pyramid.

00:01:17.484 --> 00:01:18.292
Crocodile.

00:01:19.116 --> 00:01:20.078
OSCAR ISAAC
Old flip phone.

00:01:20.133 --> 00:01:22.671
LAYLA
You're alive! What's wrong with you, Marc?

00:01:23.398 --> 00:01:25.216
STEVEN
Why did you call me Marc?

00:01:25.288 --> 00:01:26.695
♫ Day and night ♫

00:01:26.746 --> 00:01:27.521
OSCAR ISAAC
Uh-oh...

00:01:27.571 --> 00:01:29.075
ETHAN HAWKE
I look a little bit like Brando

00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:30.645
in Island of Dr. Moreau.
[Laughing]

00:01:30.696 --> 00:01:32.110
OSCAR ISAAC
It's the best Brando.

00:01:32.803 --> 00:01:33.703
STEVIE
Shut! Up!

00:01:34.503 --> 00:01:35.763
ARTHUR HARROW
There's chaos in you.

00:01:38.112 --> 00:01:41.290
OSCAR ISAAC
That was a lot of self-inflicted pain.

00:01:41.487 --> 00:01:43.196
- Ah!
- Whoa!

00:01:43.548 --> 00:01:44.779
- Pyramids, Egypt.
- Uh-oh.

00:01:46.657 --> 00:01:48.657
ARTHUR HARROW
Embrace the chaos.

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:51.366
OSCAR ISAAC
That's right. Oh, I see white. Oh!

00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:52.345
ETHAN HAWKE
Oh!

00:01:52.447 --> 00:01:53.329
OSCAR ISAAC
And there he is.

00:01:53.431 --> 00:01:54.142
In all his glory.

00:01:54.199 --> 00:01:55.670
ETHAN HAWKE
Who is he, who is he?

00:01:58.021 --> 00:02:02.448
BOTH
Ahhh! [Laughing]

00:02:02.499 --> 00:02:03.398
OSCAR ISAAC
Yes!

00:02:09.031 --> 00:02:11.210
♫ At, at, at night ♫

